<title>UK: Eksportfinans sets 10 bln yen dual currency bond.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans sets 10 bln yen dual currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EKSPORTFINANS ASA</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    27.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL CURRENCY ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAYABLE IN YEN. REDEMPTION IN EITHER DOLLARS OR YEN.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
